 "name": "PubSubHubbub Community Group",
 "is_closed": true,
 "creation-date": "2012-01-11",
 "description": "See also the <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/websub/\">WebSub W3C Recommendation</a> and the <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/community/socialcg/\">Social Web Incubator Community Group</a>.\r\n\r\nThe group will promote and design a Publish-Subscribe pattern and protocol for the web. The current de-facto protocol for it, PubSubHubbub is already widely used but has a couple issues that we need to address. \r\nWe hope this protocol can be used in wide range of applications, from social web, to e-commerce or even search engines.",
